diff --git a/docs/DEVLOG.md b/docs/DEVLOG.md
index e43395a..769d8b4 100644
--- a/docs/DEVLOG.md
+++ b/docs/DEVLOG.md
@@ -6097,3 +6097,19 @@ Decisions
 
 Next
 - Main session: record the S14 answers in "Notes from implementation" and ADR 0099's findings, decide the 26.4 Mixin (an ADR 0099 amendment), then B472 and B473.
+
+## 2026-11-15 — executor — B473 format, plugin API and facts, batch 2
+
+What
+- MSM mcdoc (ADR 0098 D1–D4, ADR 0099 D1): entity components `msm:trader` (`trade_sets` 1..5 of `{trade_set, xp_to_next?}`, `levels?`, `restock? twice_a_day|never`, `trade_sound?`, `on_trade?`), `msm:storage` (`rows? 1..6`, `needs_chest?`, `open_sound?`, `close_sound?`) and `msm:shoulder_riding` (an empty struct, the perched pet of the amended D4); kinds `villager_profession` (`job_site`, `trade_sets? @5`, `work_sound?`, `requested_items?`, `secondary_job_blocks?`; element adds `display_name`, `textures {villager, zombie_villager}`) and `fluid` (`behaves_like? water|lava|none`, `flow? {tick_delay 1..100, slope_distance 1..8, drop_off 1..4, infinite}`, `light? 0..15`, `tint? 0..16777215`, `explosion_resistance?`, `on_entity_inside?`, `events?`; element adds `display_name`, `bucket_display_name`, `textures {still, flowing, overlay, bucket}`). Schema refs `msm:villager_profession`, `msm:fluid` and their `_definition` forms; `symbols.json` regenerated (509 types). 85 new conformance cases (prefixes `trader-`, `storage-`, `shoulder-`, `profession-`, `fluid-`).
+- Plugin API 1.18.0 (same section as B471, no bump): `EntityFacts.tradeSounds` (`TradeSoundFacts {yes, no, trading}`), `vanillaJobSites` (point of interest type to blocks), `vanillaTradeSets` (`VanillaTradeSetFacts {trades, villagerOnlyTrades, villagerOnly}`); `BlockFacts.fluidModel` and `fluidTags` (`FluidTagFacts {water, lava}`).
+- Both targets carry the facts: 26.3 `two_fluids`, water `[minecraft:water]`; 26.4 `one_fluid`, water `[minecraft:water, minecraft:swimmable]`; lava `[minecraft:lava]` on both; 21 point of interest types; 68 trade sets, villager-only on `cartographer/level_2`, `cartographer/level_4` and `fisherman/level_5`. Tests tie them to the vendored registries, and `all/test/villagers.test.ts` recounts the trade sets and checks the fluid and job site tags against the Loom-cached client jar's data files when it is present (skipped otherwise); the jar reader moved to `all/test/client-jar.ts`, shared with `model-templates.test.ts`.
+
+Decisions
+- `msm:shoulder_riding` has no fields: the ADR names none, and the cooldown (100 ticks) and offset stay the runtime's.
+- `vanillaTradeSets` carries counts besides the flag, so a validator can tell "fewer offers" from "none". The data does not explain B469's armourer level 5 (none of its trades has a `merchant_predicate`); left for B474.
+- `vanillaJobSites` block lists come from the jar's block tags and names, not the game's code; `straw_bed` in `home` and the exact states are (verify at implementation).
+- The runtime's corpus JUnit test (`ConformanceCorpusTest`) does not know the five new prefixes and fails on them until they are added to its `PENDING` list; engine-mod was out of this brief's scope (B472 runs there).
+
+Next
+- Add `trader-`, `storage-`, `shoulder-`, `profession-`, `fluid-` to `ConformanceCorpusTest.PENDING` (one line) before merging, then B474–B477 remove them as their parsers land.
